From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 09:53:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix critical bugs and harden Shipora for production

Backend
- Accept email-verified users on protected endpoints (every logged-in
  request returned "account not verified")
- Make phone optional in user/profile schemas (admin endpoints 500'd)
- Fix vendor/dispatcher/both-roles KYC (date of birth, is_driver,
  service_area, blank unique fields, CAC lookup crash)
- expire_on_commit=False to stop MissingGreenlet 500s after saving
- Wallet: refunds credit the Shipora wallet instead of failing Paystack
  refunds; customer checkout payments no longer debit the vendor;
  per-user locks and reserve-before-transfer withdrawals
- Disputes: use user IDs consistently; shipment-page disputes reach admin
- Add missing endpoints: dispatcher applications, accept/decline
  invitation, logout, top-up and checkout payment verification,
  participant lookup, JSON password reset and resend verification
- Paystack webhook handles top-ups, customer payments and transfers
- Row locks on shipment state changes; auto-release sweep fixed
- Startup schema sync: tables first, savepoint per statement, advisory
  lock for multi-worker starts
- Redis URL support with JWT fallback, rate limiting on auth endpoints,
  JSON errors with CORS headers, readiness health check, stdout logging
- Remove hard-coded QoreID credentials; pin requirements; add Procfile

Frontend
- Single API base URL (src/config.js); fixes localhost calls in prod
- One session interceptor with token refresh for axios and fetch
- Fix top-up amount (was charged 100x), real payment verification,
  wired checkout, reset password, forgot password and dispute pages
- Login/signup: real error messages, resend verification, backend
  Google OAuth; Settings logout calls the API
- /shipment/:id route, catch-all route, vercel.json SPA rewrites
- ESLint passes with 0 errors

Housekeeping
- Stop tracking __pycache__ and dump.rdb

See CHANGES.md for details and the deploy checklist.

